  "summary": "Malicious code in @ornikar/babel-preset-react (npm)",
  "details": "The preinstall hook (node setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases/download/bun-v1.3.13/, extracts it, and executes a 727KB heavily-obfuscated JavaScript bundle (math_init.js) at install time. The bundle is a Bun-compiled obfuscated payload with a custom decoder and large lookup table. A babel preset has no legitimate reason to download a runtime and run obfuscated code during installation.",
